## [decision|done] Stack Decisions
See [[decisions]] for full decision log.
→ references: decisions.emd

Key decisions:
- TypeScript + React for SDK ✅
- CodeMirror 6 for editor core ✅
- CSS variables for theming ✅
- Vite for building ✅
- Vitest for testing ✅

