## [config|done] Environment Configurations

### [config|done] Development
```yaml
NODE_ENV: development
API_URL: http://localhost:8080
WS_URL: ws://localhost:8080/ws
LOG_LEVEL: debug
```

### [config|done] Production
```yaml
NODE_ENV: production
API_URL: https://api.emd.dev
WS_URL: wss://api.emd.dev/ws
LOG_LEVEL: info
SENTRY_DSN: https://...@sentry.io/...
```
